  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_01",
      "hash64": "4C786A4AA1E1E046",
      "text": "¡Hola a todos! ¿Estáis listos para disfrutar con las\\nmates una clase más?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_02",
      "hash64": "4C78694AA1E1DE93",
      "text": "Espero que hayáis podido repasar mucho lo que\\naprendimos en la clase anterior.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_03",
      "hash64": "4C78684AA1E1DCE0",
      "text": "¡Sé que las multiplicaciones y los porcentajes\\npueden resultar la mar de liosos![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_04",
      "hash64": "4C786F4AA1E1E8C5",
      "text": "Hoy vamos a profundizar un poquito en el\\ncálculo de probabilidades.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_05",
      "hash64": "4C786E4AA1E1E712",
      "text": "¡Pero no os asustéis, que no es tan difícil como\\nsuena! De hecho, es un tema con el que ya estáis\\r\\nbastante familiarizados.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_06",
      "hash64": "4C786D4AA1E1E55F",
      "text": "Cuando vuestros Pokémon usan un movimiento,\\nla probabilidad determina si acierta al rival o no.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_07",
      "hash64": "4C786C4AA1E1E3AC",
      "text": "Esto se conoce como precisión. La precisión del\\nataque Placaje, por ejemplo, es de 100.\\c\\nEs decir, que si el Pokémon usa Placaje cien\\nveces, acertará las cien.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_08",
      "hash64": "4C78734AA1E1EF91",
      "text": "Por otro lado, el movimiento Hipnosis, que\\nduerme al rival, tiene una precisión de 60.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_09",
      "hash64": "4C78724AA1E1EDDE",
      "text": "Un 60 %. De 100 veces que se usa, acierta 60...\\nDicho de otro modo, falla 40 de esas 100 veces.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_10",
      "hash64": "4C74E54AA1DEC870",
      "text": "Por lo general, los movimientos más potentes\\nsuelen tener una precisión menor.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_11",
      "hash64": "4C74E64AA1DECA23",
      "text": "Así que los Entrenadores a menudo deben elegir\\nentre movimientos flojos pero seguros y otros\\r\\ndevastadores que conllevan el riesgo de fallar.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_12",
      "hash64": "4C74E74AA1DECBD6",
      "text": "¿Veis lo que quería decir antes? Sin saberlo, ya\\nhabéis aprendido a sopesar las probabilidades.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_13",
      "hash64": "4C74E84AA1DECD89",
      "text": "Siempre que sale este tema, se suele hablar de\\nla diferencia entre Surf e Hidrobomba.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_14",
      "hash64": "4C74E94AA1DECF3C",
      "text": "Surf tiene una precisión de 100, que garantiza el\\ninfligir un daño basado en una potencia de 90.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_15",
      "hash64": "4C74EA4AA1DED0EF",
      "text": "Hidrobomba, sin embargo, tiene una precisión\\nde 80, ¡pero su potencia es de 110![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_16",
      "hash64": "4C74EB4AA1DED2A2",
      "text": "Teniendo eso en cuenta, ¿cuál de los dos\\nmovimientos os parece preferible?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_01",
      "hash64": "669BEC9254F0EEB0",
      "text": "Surf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_02",
      "hash64": "669BEF9254F0F3C9",
      "text": "Hidrobomba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_03",
      "hash64": "669BEE9254F0F216",
      "text": "Depende de la situación",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "9038381829CEBDC7",
      "text": "Se ve que eres de l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oas que prefieren ir lent[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa pero\\nsegur[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, ¿no, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
